Package: h3compactR
Title: Polygon Coverage, Compaction and Aggregation for H3 Spatial Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Rob", "Andronaco",
    email = "enquire@georiskanalysis.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(
        "GDipRiskMgt" = "Graduate Diploma in Risk Management",
        "MA" = "Master of Arts (Sports and Recreation Project Management)",
        "MGeospatialSc" = "Master of Geospatial Science"
    ))
Description:
    Provides a reproducible workflow for representing polygons with H3 cells,
    compacting those cells using established H3 methods, maintaining
    relationships between source and compacted cells, explicitly aggregating
    attributes, and validating the resulting spatial representation. The
    package builds on the H3 ecosystem and the h3jsr package, with a focus on
    reproducible spatial analysis, analytical traceability, quality assurance,
    and cartographic representation.
